<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.bag.compacts ~ the one door of compaction: history cuts and nobody's fence moves

`compact <bag-url>` takes a snapshot-restart on one bag, the DXOS-style ceremony: history bounds, and what the cut leaves out stays out (lossy by design). The house names it for what it does and for whose word it borrows: `epoch` stays RESERVED for the monotone fencing frontier a grant binds to, and a compaction CUTS history and fences nobody, so it carries the qualifier and leaves the bare word to the fence.

The answer names the old doc, the new doc, the tiddler and tombstone counts, whether the layer swapped in the composite (`not mounted` where it stands unmounted), and a note where one stands. The verb rides the UDS fast path with a WS fallback and a 30 s wait. `wiki compact <slug> <bag-url>` delegates to this same verb with a slug it never reads. One act, one address: that spelling joins this skin as `also/[[lares wiki compact]]` in the commit that flips the wiki door, since an `also` spelling gathers its door an entry and the wiki door still keeps its own table.

<<~/ahu>>

